[ti:Scarborough Fair]
[ar:Traditional]
[00:00.00]Are you going to Scarborough Fair
[00:30.00]Parsley, sage, rosemary and thyme
[01:00.00]Remember me to one who lives there
[01:30.00]She once was a true love of mine
[02:00.00]Tell her to make me a cambric shirt
[02:30.00]Parsley, sage, rosemary and thyme
[03:00.00]Without no seams nor needlework
[03:30.00]Then she'll be a true love of mine
